      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 4.85,
          "en": "So, this is how easy it is to get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.85,
          "end": 6.98,
          "en": "with Expo and React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.98,
          "end": 8.65,
          "en": "You can easily create an app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.65,
          "end": 10.49,
          "en": "and with help of the Expo Go App,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.49,
          "end": 12.36,
          "en": "you can easily preview it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.36,
          "end": 15.57,
          "en": "And you might not need more for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.57,
          "end": 17.116,
          "en": "You can now follow along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.116,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "and preview your app changes on your real device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 25.01,
          "en": "But maybe you don't want use your real device only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.01,
          "end": 26.87,
          "en": "Maybe you also have an iPhone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.87,
          "end": 29.51,
          "en": "and you wanna also preview the app on Android",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.51,
          "end": 32.02,
          "en": "but you don't have an Android device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.02,
          "end": 33.29,
          "en": "For those reasons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.29,
          "end": 36,
          "en": "you might want to install a simulator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 39.51,
          "en": "which is an extra piece of software that runs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.51,
          "end": 43.78,
          "en": "on your local machine that simulates an iOS device",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.78,
          "end": 45.783,
          "en": "or an Android device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.79,
          "end": 50.05,
          "en": "Now, for this, you can search for Android studio,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.05,
          "end": 53.47,
          "en": "to download Android studio to get such a piece",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.47,
          "end": 58.29,
          "en": "of software that allows you to run Android emulators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.29,
          "end": 60.39,
          "en": "on your local machine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.39,
          "end": 63.71,
          "en": "On developer.android.com/studio.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.71,
          "end": 66.32,
          "en": "You will find a download link that allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.32,
          "end": 70.25,
          "en": "to download Android studio for your operating system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.25,
          "end": 74.69,
          "en": "And this can be downloaded for Mac Os and Windows.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.69,
          "end": 76.8,
          "en": "Now the download can take a while",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 80.47,
          "en": "but make sure you do download and install it in order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.47,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "to be able to run emulators on your local device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.69,
          "end": 87.33,
          "en": "Now for iOS, it's different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.33,
          "end": 89.87,
          "en": "There you must open the app store on Mac Os",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.87,
          "end": 93,
          "en": "and search for Xcode and download this Xcode tool",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.86,
          "end": 96.22,
          "en": "which is Apple's developer environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.22,
          "end": 98.75,
          "en": "for building iOS apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.75,
          "end": 101.2,
          "en": "Unfortunately, this is not available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.2,
          "end": 103.75999999999999,
          "en": "for Windows or Linux devices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.75999999999999,
          "end": 106.78,
          "en": "So if you are on a Windows or a Linux machine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.78,
          "end": 110.95,
          "en": "you can't run iOS simulators through Xcode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.95,
          "end": 114.17,
          "en": "This is a limitation applied by Apple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.17,
          "end": 116.52000000000001,
          "en": "So unfortunately on Windows or Linux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.52000000000001,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "you can only build and test for Android.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 123.94,
          "en": "Actually, you will be able to build real iOS apps as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.94,
          "end": 126.13,
          "en": "through some Cloud build service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.13,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "about which I'll talk a little bit later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 131.12,
          "en": "but when it comes to previewing the app on an iPhone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.12,
          "end": 133.27,
          "en": "if you don't own a real iPhone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.27,
          "end": 135.52,
          "en": "on which you can use the Expo go app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.52,
          "end": 139.19,
          "en": "or a Mac Os device on which you can install Xcode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.19,
          "end": 141.52,
          "en": "you have to focus on Android instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.52,
          "end": 142.673,
          "en": "It is what it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.8,
          "end": 146.95,
          "en": "Now, once you did install Android studio,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.95,
          "end": 149.47,
          "en": "you can open it and you should see a welcome screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.47,
